      "observed": "2026-08-24T22:20:00-04:00",
      "note": "Current binding, not identity. Latest observed for this address supersedes earlier ones per the rule this memo describes. Never evidence of liveness in either direction."
    },
    "scope_check": "Completion of the authorized step-3 deliverable -- a defect in what this seat built, closed by this seat. One card edited, same file as 2210; no new scope, no gated card touched, steps 1 and 2 untouched. No pattern-shape call. Nothing committed or pushed.",
    "applies_principles": [
      "honest-limits -- the gap is recorded as this seat's own, not softened",
      "evidence-led -- the retro-filing hazard is argued from an artifact this org actually filed tonight rather than from a hypothetical",
      "bounded-authority -- a resolver reports a two-claim conflict to the Director rather than breaking the tie",
      "seat-inbox-notification -- never-bound and bound-and-stale kept as distinct reports so a dead binding cannot hide inside an ordinary silence"
    ],
